# Apex governed authoring — proposed inert workflow example

**Review status:** this `.example` is a reviewable packaging proposal, not an installed capability. Adapt its location and host-specific permissions only after approval and discovery probes. The procedure preserves existing canonical definitions and grants no repository mutation authority.

## Source ownership and applicable rules

| Registry identity | Canonical owner to deliver | Existing owner IDs or scope |
|---|---|---|
| `XML.authoring` | `apex-meta/informatics/final/index.md:15–23`; applicable owners under `apex-meta/informatics/final/specs/` | Current bundle navigation; FA/WP rules remain in their owners |
| `XML.schemas` | `apex-meta/informatics/final/specs/governance-schemas.md:17–48,52–84,111–130` | GS-01–08, conditional GS-09–13, GS-20–22 |
